In article <LCL.92Feb28140940@splinter.coe.northeastern.edu> lcl@splinter.coe.northeastern.edu (Lisa C. Lewis) writes:
>
>When writing on blank scrolls with a magic marker, does one write, for example,
>"identify" or, depending what the scroll is in that game, "TEMOV"?  Or does it
>matter?  Also, should the blank scroll be blessed or the marker be blessed - 
>or again, can it work either way?
>
One must write "identify", "remove curse", etc.  You have to have read a
scroll of that type before you can write it.  To get a blessed scroll, the
blank scroll should be blessed.
[Medusa stuff deleted]
